      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like everyone keeps telling me things will get better or that i should reach out, but nothing actually changes. the tiredness is just... it's constant. i look at my life and there's nothing there for me anymore. everything is just gray. honestly, it feels more like a relief to think about just letting go than it does to keep fighting this every single day. does that make sense? like, is it even wrong to want it to just be over?",
